FINAL_ANSWER=The bug is in `proportional_refund`: it uses `int(raw * 100) / 100`, which truncates toward zero. The requirement is half-up rounding (e.g. 0.125 → 0.13), so it should use `round(raw * 100) / 100`. The other helper functions are correct and must not be changed.
